{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_17386","headline":"从叔将军宅蔷薇花开太府韦卿有题壁长句因以和作 · 权德舆","name":"从叔将军宅蔷薇花开太府韦卿有题壁长句因以和作","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"环列从容蹀躞归，光风骀荡发红薇。\n莺藏密叶宜新霁，蝶遶低枝爱晚晖。\n艳色当轩迷舞袖，繁香满迳拂朝衣。\n名卿洞壑仍相近，佳句新成和者稀。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"权德舆","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_17386.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_17386","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}